  "description": "Ed25519 license verification for MMPWorks paid packages. v2 wire format + v2.1 caps/cv claim expansion. Engine (pure verifier with EditionCapabilityPresets cap-set resolution) + platform (locator, cache, gate) layers. v2.2 adds license-lifecycle surface (LicenseStateMachine, DemoModeSource, LicenseNag), trusted-clock binding (ITrustedClock three-tier resolution), and hosted check-in client (CheckInClient with Polly v8 resilience) per ADR-211/214/216/219. Source-linked by consumer products per ADR-0001.",
